  "review_fixes": [
    "Capture lifecycle timestamps as explicit UTC ISO8601 scalars before SQL binding, avoiding mutable Carbon audit conversion changing a pending write.",
    "Preserve all previously supported pause reasons while adding doctor_delayed only for pause.",
    "Retrieve the doctor's active session and explicitly selected eligible session independently of the normal 60-session list cap.",
    "Refresh date, session_id and state alongside the partial Doctor payload to keep the selector aligned with server selection.",
    "Keep a pending command immutable across partial reloads, active-card appearance/disappearance and delegation changes.",
    "Remove internal visit versions from visible product text and clarify priority decision ordering.",
    "Cap Doctor and Team mobile padding without reducing 200-percent text size; detect split action words using DOM Range in every layout case."
  ],
